  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Kenya&#xbf;s Devolution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Kenya&#xbf;s devolution is the successor to the Instruments for Devolution Advice and Support (IDEAS) programme, 2014-19. The proposed Action aims at reinforcing devolution as a key process to consolidate democracy, good governance and service delivery at the local level, while addressing regional disparities in access to resources and services. It will specifically target to strengthen the core governance systems at county level and will provide support for own source revenue (OSR) mobilisation, including the automation of revenue collection systems as well as efforts geared at unlocking the Equalisation Fund with a view to reducing marginalisation. By improving local governance and revenue collection, this action will be complementary to the EU-Kenya Green and Digital partnership under the Global Gateway.</narrative>
  </description>
